  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2381f95ecfcbe7f6eaceba831d02f99bf624c84151895e65ac4d5a630f47ff34.png] \n\nThe given equation is:\n\n(16 ÷ 4) × 6 + 26 - 48 + 9 × 8 = 154\n\n**Option 1: Interchange 26 and 48**\n\nEquation: (16 ÷ 4) × 6 + 48 - 26 + 9 × 8 = 154\n\nEvaluating: __**(16 ÷ 4)**__ × 6 + 48 - 26 + __**9 × 8**__\n\n= __**4 × 6**__ + 48 - 26 + 72\n\n= __**24 + 48**__ - 26 + 72\n\n= __**72 - 26**__ + 72\n\n= __**46 + 72**__\n\n= 118<",
